    "ありがとう。星の底が開いた。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thank you. The Starfloor is open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いつものリバーシ。1 階 1 局で、勝てば下の階へ。階ごとに盤の形と番人が変わる。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Classic reversi rules. Win a game to go down a floor. Every floor brings a new board and a new warden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いま %d 個": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは購入できません。通信できる所で、あとでもう一度開いてください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Purchases aren't available right now. Please try again later with a connection."
